# E §3.1 step 1: "A joint model's use line pins a member by this hash, written as 64 lower-case hexadecimal digits";
# L §6.1 a member that doesn't match its hash is refused (LOAD-PIN). The hash here is the member's, in upper case.
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "DA53B6FF6A096D47B9AF5E16E8276735E72B3C343160D17D841C6BA432DF1720"

ask r: a.rate
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"

input rate: num

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  rate = 0.12 "umowa"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PIN ana.tally doesn't match its sha256 in use a
